WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:04.040
If you watch my program with any regularity,
you probably won't be shocked to hear me say

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:06.180
that I'm against violence. I'm against terrorism.

00:00:06.180 --> 00:00:11.640
Assume I'm against criminality and vandalism
so I have to call it out no matter who the

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:15.370
perpetrators are. And there's a story that's
gotten relatively little coverage, but it's

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:21.250
extremely disturbing, which is that a self-described
antifascists and anarchists showed up at an

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:26.301
ice facility near Seattle. Washington fire
bombed the place, attempted to bar a burn

00:00:26.301 --> 00:00:30.990
cars, buildings. I'll have the details for
you in a second. The man ultimately died after

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.010
being shot by police. He actually said that
he was motivated by the recent immigration

00:00:36.010 --> 00:00:42.350
raids and deportations that the Trump administration
has been undertaking and the facility in question

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:48.629
had actually had an organized protest earlier
in the day and the fire bomber showed up after

00:00:48.629 --> 00:00:53.641
hours very early. The following morning, four
or 5:00 AM through incendiary devices, lit

00:00:53.641 --> 00:00:58.809
a car on fire, tried burning down buildings
and approached pain tank and generally wreaked

00:00:58.809 --> 00:01:04.470
havoc. We're talking about a 69 year old and
as I mentioned, police ultimately shot him

00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:05.470
dead.

00:01:05.470 --> 00:01:11.490
Now, the same guy was arrested last year at
a protest outside the same detention center

00:01:11.490 --> 00:01:18.070
after allegedly jumping onto a police officer.
We know the man's motivations, uh, because

00:01:18.070 --> 00:01:22.859
before he showed up, he wrote a letter to
friends calling it a manifesto saying he was

00:01:22.859 --> 00:01:30.030
going to quote, take action against the forces
of evil, specifically fascism and quote, concentration

00:01:30.030 --> 00:01:35.729
camps. He wrote, I am Antifa, although later
he also said he's not actually affiliated

00:01:35.729 --> 00:01:41.060
with any organization. So listen, w when these
things happen, it's important for progressive

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:47.250
commentators to talk about it. When we don't,
we do two things. Number one, we give the

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:52.069
