are not, though the hypocrisy right now is

00:01:57.030 --> 00:01:59.609
mostly on the right. And we need to keep it
that way.

00:01:59.609 --> 00:02:05.659
If we're against violence, we need to condemn
it in all forms, no matter the political orientation.

00:02:05.659 --> 00:02:13.969
Now, just as importantly, it's important to,
uh, talk about these stories because it does

00:02:13.969 --> 00:02:20.200
